COMMENT     VALIDATED REFSEQ: This record has undergone validation or
            preliminary review. The reference sequence was derived from
            JBMGRA010000005.1, CT635558.2, CT619016.1, CT704385.2 and
            EH479527.1.
            
            On Nov 29, 2012 this sequence version replaced NM_131327.1.
            
            Transcript Variant: This variant (2) uses an alternate splice site
            in the 5' coding region compared to variant 1. The resulting
            protein (isoform 2) is shorter but has the same N- and C-termini
            compared to isoform 1.
            
            Publication Note:  This RefSeq record includes a subset of the
            publications that are available for this gene. Please see the Gene
            record to access additional publications.
            
